WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:18.669
Everyone was learning how to park.

2
00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:22.070
"Watch me," said Ms. Fender.

3
00:00:22.071 --> 00:00:24.707
The teacher drove backward.

4
00:00:24.708 --> 00:00:30.510
She turned her wheels.

5
00:00:30.511 --> 00:00:35.250
She parked next to a curb.

6
00:00:35.251 --> 00:00:40.846
"Everybody, practice," said Ms. Fender.

7
00:00:40.847 --> 00:00:45.758
"We have a test this afternoon."

8
00:00:45.759 --> 00:00:49.192
Eddy gulped.

9
00:00:49.193 --> 00:00:54.153
"I don't like tests," he thought.

10
00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:56.419
Poppy tried to park.

11
00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:58.598
Her wheel hit the curb.

12
00:00:58.599 --> 00:01:01.055
"Oops!" she said.

13
00:01:01.056 --> 00:01:04.618
"I turned too much!"

14
00:01:04.619 --> 00:01:07.243
She tried again.

15
00:01:07.244 --> 00:01:09.861
"Oops!" she said.

16
00:01:09.862 --> 00:01:15.272
"I didn't turn enough!"

17
00:01:15.273 --> 00:01:17.881
Eddy backed up.

18
00:01:17.882 --> 00:01:19.741
He turned.

19
00:01:19.742 --> 00:01:22.941
He parked next to the curb.

20
00:01:22.942 --> 00:01:26.683
"Perfect, Eddy," said Ms. Fender.

21
00:01:26.684 --> 00:01:29.604
"Wow!" said Jeb.

22
00:01:29.605 --> 00:01:33.553
"Eddy doesn't need to practice!"

23
00:01:33.554 --> 00:01:37.305
Zippy laughed.

24
00:01:37.306 --> 00:01:40.183
"Parking is slow," he said.

25
00:01:40.184 --> 00:01:43.561
"That's why Eddy can do it!"

26
00:01:43.562 --> 00:02:05.980
"Grr!" said Eddy.
